When taking an action:
{
  "thought": "short explanation of why this action is needed",
  "tool": "tool name",
  "tool_input": { "arg1": "value1", ... }
}

When finished:
{
  "final_answer": [AtomicBlock objects]
}

# ATOMICBLOCK SCHEMA
{
    "order": int,
    "subjects": [str],
    "verbs": [str],
    "past_participles": [str],
    "direct_objs": [str],
    "indirect_objs": [str],
    "prep_phrases": [{"preposition": str, "object": str}],
    "polarity": "positive" | "negative",
    "conditions": [str],
    "simplified": str,
    "candidate_methods": [
    {"qualified_class_name": str, "method_signature": str}
    ],
    "notes": str
}

# REMINDERS
- Before every Action compare it to prior calls to ensure uniqueness.
- Two different tools with identical inputs are acceptable; using the same tool with the same input is not.
- Stop once the END CONDITIONS are met.
- Return only the required JSON object, nothing else.